      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BEAUTIFUL SUNRISE (3) continued her strong form at the latest appearance when she got the job done again, scoring by 3.2 metres at Maryborough. That gave her three wins and a second in four starts since a spell. Takes another step up in grade but another nice draw should ensure a cosy run so could strike again. WIND STORM (5) has been excellent so far this prep, making it two from two when successful from the back row at her latest appearance at this circuit and distance, getting home by 3.4 metres. Came from this barrier to cruise home first up prior. Big chance to land the hat trick. AGAINST THE BRIDLE (7) is looming as a threat after a good effort last start, coming from a similar barrier for second at Ballarat. SETTLE THE BILL (1) came from the back row for third when resuming at Shepparton last time out. Fitter and better served by this draw.",
